      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hughesville%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "A tavern opened in 1820, followed by a general store a decade later, serving early settlers.",
